   "Curriculum song (Prep A, prep-a.allegro). Frère Jacques, French traditional; public domain. Our own arrangement (the bells simplified to quarter notes). The bells' \"ding, dang, dong\" is now the brother still in bed (at the parent's request, Oct 7, 2026: the vocal garbled the ding-dongs)."
